# 08_swamp_grappleguardian_dark, layer 3: u052e and u04fa activated, forced chain as grenchler_grapple.con,
# then at f1500 the forced (statecall) defaults: MorphballBite 3, GrappleBreak 3, Null 0.
# Run as grenchler_grapple.con.
